### Comandos Uteis

```bash
# Rebuild backend
docker compose build backend --no-cache

# Reiniciar container
docker compose up -d backend --force-recreate

# Verificar logs
docker logs conecta-pro-backend --tail 50

# Rodar testes
docker exec conecta-pro-backend python -m pytest tests/ -q --tb=no

# Testar health
curl -s http://localhost:8080/health
```

